Z||000000||BroCar 87||10-04-2000||09:01 PM||||I replied in a post on the TECH section of the forum and due to the responce of my comment of the N. Florida S. Georgia Fiero club I think it would be good to address this on its own thread. <BR>RobVol is the President of our club, and he is a VERRRRY busy guy. We haven't set a date yet as to when we will hold our first annual meeting. I CAN'T WAIT!!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> Since there are alot of new people on this forum, I was wondering who would be able to make it to our meeting. Of course it depends on the day of the meeting but who is in our area??<BR>I see that quite a few people can make it, even though they live quite a distance away. Which is AWESOME!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR>If anyone else is interested in our club, you can either email<BR>Robert at RobertVol71@cs.com<BR>or me (Joey) at BroCar87@aol.com<P>So just outta curiosity... Who would like to make it to one of our meetings sometime?<P><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Signature2.jpg"> <BR>87 Coupe "IRON BEAST"<BR>84 SE (project)||||reg||10
